#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "🚀 2026-yilgi islohot bo'yicha yillik aylanmasi **1 mlrd so'mgacha** bo'lgan o'zini o'zi band qilganlar **1%** soliq to'laydi (12% o'rniga).\n\nOylik daromadingiz va sohangizni yozing — tejamkorlikni hisoblab beraman. Yoki [Frilanser 1%](/freelancer/) kalkulyatoridan foydalaning."
msgstr "🚀 Under the 2026 reform, self-employed people with an annual turnover **up to 1 billion UZS** pay **1%** tax (instead of 12%).\n\nTell me your monthly income and field — I'll calculate your savings. Or use the [Freelancer 1%](/freelancer/) calculator."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "🔍 **Avto-Audit** uchun Click, Payme, Uzum yoki Anorbank ilovasidan 1 yillik xarajatlar hisobotini PDF ko'rinishida yuklab oling va [Avto-Audit](/audit/) sahifasidagi **'Fayl yuklash'** maydoniga tashlang. Tizim universitet, bog'cha, maktab va tibbiyot to'lovlarini o'zi topib, qaytariladigan 12% ni hisoblaydi."
msgstr "🔍 For **Auto-Audit**, download a one-year spending statement as PDF from Click, Payme, Uzum or Anorbank and drop it into **«Upload a file»** on the [Auto-Audit](/audit/) page. The system finds university, kindergarten, school and medical payments and calculates the 12% refund."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "💸 **Ikki baravar foyda** formulasi:\n\nUmumiy foyda = **12% soliq qaytarilishi** + **ilova keshbegi** − **komissiya**\n\n[Keshbek optimizatori](/cashback/) bo'limiga shartnoma summasini kiriting — Click, Payme, Anorbank, Uzum va Zoomrad bir jadvalda taqqoslanadi."
msgstr "💸 The **double benefit** formula:\n\nTotal benefit = **12% tax refund** + **app cashback** − **fee**\n\nEnter the contract amount in the [Cashback optimizer](/cashback/) — Click, Payme, Anorbank, Uzum and Zoomrad are compared in one table."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "📸 [Chek skanerlash](/scan/) sahifasida chek skrinshoti (PNG, JPG) yoki PDF kvitansiyani **'Fayl yuklash'** maydoniga tashlang.\n\nTizim **To'lov summasi**, **Sana** va **STIR** raqamini avtomatik ajratib, kalkulyator formasiga joylashtiradi — siz faqat tekshirib **'Tasdiqlash'** tugmasini bosasiz.\n\n💡 Rasm aniq, yorug' va to'liq kadrda bo'lsin."
msgstr "📸 On the [Scan a receipt](/scan/) page, drop a receipt screenshot (PNG, JPG) or a PDF invoice into **«Upload a file»**.\n\nThe system extracts the **payment amount**, **date** and **TIN** and fills in the form — you just check and press **«Confirm»**.\n\n💡 The photo should be sharp, well lit and fully in frame."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "🎓 Ta'lim (kontrakt), bog'cha, maktab va tibbiyot to'lovlaridan **12% JShOD** qaytariladi.\n\n1. [Chek skanerlash](/scan/) — chekni yuklang\n2. Ma'lumotlarni tasdiqlang\n3. [Shaxsiy kabinet](/dashboard/)da arizani shakllantiring\n\nTo'lov summasini yozsangiz, qancha qaytishini hozir hisoblab beraman."
msgstr "🎓 **12% PIT** is refunded on tuition (contract), kindergarten, school and medical payments.\n\n1. [Scan a receipt](/scan/) — upload the receipt\n2. Confirm the details\n3. Create the application in [My dashboard](/dashboard/)\n\nTell me the payment amount and I'll calculate the refund right away."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "🔒 Shaxsiy ma'lumotlaringiz (pasport, STIR, karta) Maxfiylik siyosatiga muvofiq himoyalangan holda saqlanadi. Biz hech qachon karta CVV kodi yoki SMS-kodni so'ramaymiz."
msgstr "🔒 Your personal data (passport, TIN, card) is stored securely under our Privacy Policy. We never ask for your card CVV or SMS code."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "Salom! 👋 Men **Magnit** AI-yordamchisiman. Quyidagilarda yordam beraman:\n\n- 🎓 Kontrakt, bog'cha, tibbiyot to'lovlaridan **12% soliqni qaytarish**\n- 📸 Cheklarni **OCR** orqali skanerlash\n- 🔍 PDF-hisobotni **Avto-Audit** qilish\n- 💸 Eng foydali **keshbek** va kam komissiyali to'lov usuli\n- 🚀 Frilanserlar uchun **12% → 1%** soliq optimizatsiyasi\n\nSavolingizni yozing yoki summani kiriting (masalan: *kontrakt 12 mln*)."
msgstr "Hi! 👋 I'm the **Magnit** AI assistant. I can help with:\n\n- 🎓 **getting 12% tax back** on tuition, kindergarten and medical payments\n- 📸 scanning receipts with **OCR**\n- 🔍 **Auto-Audit** of a PDF statement\n- 💸 the best **cashback** and the lowest-fee way to pay\n- 🚀 **12% → 1%** tax optimization for freelancers\n\nType your question or an amount (e.g. *tuition 12M*)."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "🚀 Oylik daromad **%(monthly)s so'm** bo'lsa:\n- 12%% JShOD: **%(general)s so'm/yil**\n- 1%% (o'zini o'zi band): **%(reduced)s so'm/yil**\n\nSiz yiliga **%(savings)s so'm** tejaysiz!%(note)s\n\nBatafsil hisob uchun [Frilanser 1%%](/freelancer/) bo'limiga o'ting."
msgstr "🚀 With a monthly income of **%(monthly)s UZS**:\n- 12%% PIT: **%(general)s UZS/year**\n- 1%% (self-employed): **%(reduced)s UZS/year**\n\nYou save **%(savings)s UZS** a year!%(note)s\n\nSee the detailed calculation in [Freelancer 1%%](/freelancer/)."

#: core/services/assistant.py
msgid "🎓 **%(amount)s so'm** to'lovdan **%(refund)s so'm** (12%% JShOD) qaytarib olishingiz mumkin!\n\nBuning uchun to'lov chekini [Chek skanerlash](/scan/) sahifasiga yuklang, so'ng [Shaxsiy kabinet](/dashboard/)da **'Ariza shakllantirish'** tugmasini bosing."
msgstr "🎓 From a **%(amount)s UZS** payment you can get back **%(refund)s UZS** (12%% PIT)!\n\nUpload the receipt on the [Scan a receipt](/scan/) page, then press **«Create application»** in [My dashboard](/dashboard/)."

#: core/services/assistant.py
