#: core/views.py
msgid "Magnit nima?"
msgstr "What is Magnit?"

#: core/views.py
msgid "Magnit — ta'lim, bog'cha, maktab va tibbiyot to'lovlaridan 12% JShOD (daromad solig'i)ni qaytarib olishga yordam beruvchi platforma. Cheklarni o'qiydi, mos to'lovlarni topadi va ariza reestrini tayyorlaydi."
msgstr "Magnit is a platform that helps you get 12% PIT (income tax) back on tuition, kindergarten, school and medical payments. It reads receipts, finds eligible payments and prepares the application register."

#: core/views.py
msgid "Kimlar soliqni qaytarib olishi mumkin?"
msgstr "Who can get the tax back?"

#: core/views.py
msgid "Rasmiy ish joyidan maosh olib, 12% daromad solig'i to'layotgan har bir fuqaro o'zi, farzandi yoki yaqinlari uchun qilingan mos to'lovlar bo'yicha soliqni qaytarishi mumkin."
msgstr "Every citizen who earns an official salary and pays 12% income tax can get the tax back on eligible payments made for themselves, their children or relatives."

#: core/views.py
msgid "Qaysi to'lovlar mos keladi?"
msgstr "Which payments are eligible?"

#: core/views.py
msgid "Oliy ta'lim kontrakti, bog'cha, maktab, tibbiyot muassasalari va shartnomaviy to'lovlar. Aniq ro'yxat Soliq kodeksiga muvofiq yangilanib boriladi."
msgstr "University tuition contracts, kindergarten, school, medical institutions and contract payments. The exact list is updated in line with the Tax Code."

#: core/views.py
msgid "\"Chek skanerlash\" bo'limida PNG, JPG yoki PDF faylni tashlang. Summa, sana va STIR avtomatik to'ldiriladi — siz faqat tekshirib tasdiqlaysiz."
msgstr "In «Scan a receipt», drop a PNG, JPG or PDF file. The amount, date and TIN are filled in automatically — you just check and confirm."

#: core/views.py
msgid "Avto-Audit qanday ishlaydi?"
msgstr "How does Auto-Audit work?"

#: core/views.py
msgid "Click, Payme, Uzum yoki Anorbank ilovasidan yillik PDF-hisobotni yuklaysiz. Tizim universitet, bog'cha, maktab va klinikalarga qilingan to'lovlarni o'zi ajratib beradi."
msgstr "You upload a one-year PDF statement from Click, Payme, Uzum or Anorbank. The system picks out payments to universities, kindergartens, schools and clinics."

#: core/views.py
msgid "Ariza qayerga topshiriladi?"
msgstr "Where is the application submitted?"

#: core/views.py
msgid "Magnit ariza reestrini tayyorlaydi. Rasmiy ariza my.soliq.uz orqali yoki soliq inspeksiyasiga topshiriladi."
msgstr "Magnit prepares the application register. The official application is submitted via my.soliq.uz or at the tax inspectorate."

#: core/views.py
msgid "Xizmat pullikmi?"
msgstr "Is the service paid?"

#: core/views.py
msgid "Bepul tarif doimo bepul. Oila va Frilanser tariflari qo'shimcha imkoniyatlar beradi. Biz qaytgan pulingizdan foiz olmaymiz."
msgstr "The free plan is always free. The Family and Freelancer plans add more features. We don't take a cut of your refund."

#: core/views.py
